WEBVTT

00:03:55.940 --> 00:04:00.194
So you can join and you can relax
your muscles in your body.

00:04:00.236 --> 00:04:02.655
If you cannot relax, also OK, allowed.

00:04:02.697 --> 00:04:03.698
(Laughter)

00:04:03.739 --> 00:04:08.369
And close your eyes,
and please listen to sound.

00:04:08.411 --> 00:04:09.704
(Ding)

00:04:11.455 --> 00:04:14.750
And when you hear the sound,

00:04:14.792 --> 00:04:18.170
through ear and mind together ...

00:04:18.212 --> 00:04:19.338
(Ding)

00:04:20.214 --> 00:04:21.674
That is the meditation.

00:04:23.217 --> 00:04:25.511
And let panic come and go.

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.680
Let pizza come and go.

00:04:28.639 --> 00:04:29.974
(Ding)